#: addon\globalPlugins\WordBridge\dictionary\dialog.py:14
msgid ""
"Guideline:\n"
"Users can add words to improve the accuracy of added terms. It is "
"recommended to add specialized terms that may not be present in the model's "
"training data or terms that the model frequently make mistakes. The "
"pronunciation (pinyin or zhuyin) of an added word is optional, but providing "
"it can help improve correctness.\n"
"\n"
"For the format of pronunciation (pinyin or zhuyin), please see the following "
"rules and examples\n"
"1. Please insert a space between pronunciation of characters\n"
"2. Please use v instead of ü for pinyin\n"
"3. Please use number for pinyin's tone (no number for neutral tone)\n"
"\n"
"Example1:\n"
"Word: 爸爸\n"
"Pinyin: ba4 ba\n"
"Zhuyin: ㄅㄚˋ ㄅㄚ˙\n"
"\n"
"Example2:\n"
"Word: 旅遊\n"
"Pinyin: lv3 you2\n"
"Zhuyin: ㄌㄩˇ ㄧㄡˊ"
msgstr ""
"說明：\n"
"使用者可以新增詞彙，以提高這些詞彙的辨識準確度。建議新增模型訓練資料中可能沒"
"有的專有名詞，或模型經常誤用的詞彙。詞彙的發音（拼音或注音）可填可不填，但提"
"供發音有助於提高正確性。\n"
"\n"
"發音（拼音或注音）的格式請參考以下規則與範例：\n"
"1. 請在每個字的發音之間插入空格\n"
"2. 拼音中的 ü 請以 v 代替\n"
"3. 拼音聲調請使用數字表示（輕聲不標數字）\n"
"\n"
"範例1：\n"
"詞彙：爸爸\n"
"拼音：ba4 ba\n"
"注音：ㄅㄚˋ ㄅㄚ˙\n"
"\n"
"範例2：\n"
"詞彙：旅遊\n"
"拼音：lv3 you2\n"
"注音：ㄌㄩˇ ㄧㄡˊ"

